teach in the Ultimate AI Agentic course that's coming soon on jsmastery.com.

196
00:17:37,472 --> 00:17:44,420
我已经研究这个课程一年多了，分析如何与智能体协作以及如何最大限度地发挥它们的优势。
I've been working on that one for more than a year now, analyzing how
to work with agents and the best way to make the most out of them.

197
00:17:45,390 --> 00:17:55,200
如果你还没操作的话，我会在描述栏留下链接，你可以完全免费加入候补名单，
