1051
01:39:35,310 --> 01:39:44,132
你可以把它想象成一个存放许多组件需要共享的应用状态的地方，
而不需要到处传递 props 或者编写 Redux 风格的样板代码。
You can think of it as a place to keep app state that many components need to share,
without passing props everywhere or writing Redux style boilerplate.

1052
01:39:44,398 --> 01:39:57,988
而 Async storage 是本地持久化键值存储，它在设备上保存小块数据，比如设置、
缓存的应用状态、标志或任何非敏感的会话数据。
And async storage is a local persistent key value storage, which saves small pieces of data on the device like settings,
cached app state, flags, or any non-sensitive session data.

1053
01:39:58,542 --> 01:40:00,384
所以这里的思路很简单。
So the idea here is simple.

1054
01:40:00,686 --> 01:40:08,544
Zestand 在内存中管理应用状态，而 Async storage 在设备上本地持久化这些状态。
