03:20:32,782 --> 03:20:44,868
它需要把 Python 智能体从需要完整语音意图检测、速度较慢的语义语音活动检测，
切换到基于能量的服务器端语音活动检测，后者在出现任何音频时可在 100 毫秒内触发。
It needs to switch the Python agent from semantic VAD, which needs full speech intent detection, which is slow, to server VAD,
which is energy based, and fires within 100 milliseconds of any audio appearing.

2208
03:20:45,358 --> 03:20:54,736
我们想把打断响应设置为 true，这样一旦 VAD 触发，音频的智能体输出就会立即停止，
而 VAD 会在麦克风打开并拾取到环境音时立即触发。
We want to set the interrupt response to true so the audio's agent output stops the instant the VAD fires,
which happens as soon as the mic opens and picks up ambient sound.

2209
03:20:54,816 --> 03:20:56,836
